flowchart TD
  A([Card payment]) --> B{Webhook enabled,<br/>signature valid?}
  B -->|no| B1[503 or 401]
  B -->|yes| C{Event already<br/>seen?}
  C -->|yes| C1[200 duplicate]
  C -->|no| D{Event checks pass?<br/>date, total, location,<br/>overpayment}
  D -->|no, or refund /<br/>failed charge| X[Flag for accounting<br/>review; 200]
  D -->|yes| E[Receipt operation:<br/>manual_action_required]
  D -->|yes| F[Fee operation: queued]
  E --> E1[Owner receivable updated;<br/>staff reminded each minute]
  F --> G[[On-prem fee writer claims]]
  G --> H{Fee already<br/>in accounting?}
  H -->|yes| H1[already_in_sage]
  H -->|no| H2[Post GL entry:<br/>succeeded]
  D -.other error.-> Y[500: provider<br/>redelivers]
